        "branch": {"code": "s 3B(1)"},
        "eligible_wages": "6400.00",
        "levy": "172.80",
        "levy_before_rounding": "172.80",
        "workings": {"base_rate_of_pay_grossed_up": "6000.00", "formula_a": "6400.00", "formula_b": "4800.00", "winner": "formula_a"},
        "excluded_components": ["pay.bonuses[1]", "pay.bonuses[2]"]
      },
      "derivation": "s 3B(4)(a): 5000.00 + 1000.00 sacrificed = 6000.00 base. Monthly 400.00 counts; annual and quarterly bonuses are not paid at least monthly and drop out. Formula A = 6400.00; Formula B = 0.75 x 6400.00 = 4800.00. Levy = 6400.00 x 0.027 = 172.80. January 2024 is the first month of the amended s 3B and must be supported."
